{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（11日）早上6時53分，警方接獲大圍美田路25-35號美松苑保安員報案，指發現其同事暈倒在屋苑閘口。救援人員接報到場，發現一名姓陳（46歲）的男保安員昏迷不醒，隨即由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。男子暈倒原因仍有待調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"一名姓陳（46歲）的男保安員昏迷不醒，由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186579113062699008578136.jpeg/S45agy7D681RT4AT_0LwAj0JJUjlglfVOcz-aznM_ms\"/><figcaption>一名姓陳（46歲）的男保安員昏迷不醒，由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:29:57.405506+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:57:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T09:29:31.729924+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T01:23:33.685658+00:00","content_hash":"74b5adff49548f1fc9a3ab26298a4089061febe373c7cf37f4605e44543f9e32","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}